※ pl4g-test: compile=ok opt=0,1 run=native,qemu exit=0 diag=none

※ `comptime foreach` walks a tuple, and it is the one loop whose turns may
※ differ in type: a tuple's members are of whatever types they were written
※ with, so the body is written out once per member rather than run again.
※ There is no loop in what comes out -- no counter, no branch backwards, no
※ test -- which is also why it has nothing to hand over.
※
※ `comptime if` asks which type this turn's name is of.  `⎕typeof` answers a
※ type, and a type is not a value: it may stand only in a question the
※ compiler settles, and the arms it does not choose are not lowered at all --
※ which is what lets them be of types that would not otherwise agree.

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    let values: 〈u8, u16, u32, u8, u16〉 = 〈1u8, 2u16, 3u32, 4u8, 5u16〉
    let bytes: mut u8 = 0u8
    let halves: mut u16 = 0u16
    let words: mut u32 = 0u32
    comptime foreach v := values:
        comptime if ⎕typeof(v) = u8:
            bytes ← bytes + v
        comptime elif ⎕typeof(v) = u16:
            halves ← halves + v
        comptime elif ⎕typeof(v) = u32:
            words ← words + v
        else:
            words ← words
    ※ the logical operators join what the compiler settled
    let joined: mut u8 = 0u8
    comptime foreach w := values:
        comptime if ⎕typeof(w) = u8 ∨ ⎕typeof(w) = u16:
            joined ← joined + 1u8
    ※ a tuple of one type walks the same way
    let alike: 〈u8, u8〉 = 〈6u8, 7u8〉
    let summed: mut u8 = 0u8
    comptime foreach a := alike:
        summed ← summed + a
    ※ a type written on the name says what every turn must be, where it is
    let named: mut u8 = 0u8
    comptime foreach b: u8 = alike:
        named ← named + b
    if bytes ≠ 5u8 ∨ halves ≠ 7u16 ∨ words ≠ 3u32:
        1u8
    elif joined ≠ 4u8:
        2u8
    elif summed ≠ 13u8 ∨ named ≠ 13u8:
        3u8
    ※ and one that is settled outside a loop, with an arm that is not
    else:
        comptime if ⎕typeof(bytes) ≠ u8:
            4u8
        elif halves = 7u16:
            0u8
        else:
            5u8
